      "en": "The LORD is righteous. He has cut apart the cords of the wicked.",
      "ko": "여호와께서는 의로우사 악인의 줄을 끊으셨도다",
      "source_text_hash": "ad3064be19cb0452fc259688af991c53934c360ddfe68223248c30d3814e4dfd",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2082299007e0ac1ef51391d3c4c8d3f345ab3f9f19818c3e3b4fca4a5321db6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서는 의로우사 악인의 줄을 끊으셨도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e2082299007e0ac1ef51391d3c4c8d3f345ab3f9f19818c3e3b4fca4a5321db6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:129:5",
